et until complete. A scanned PDF page has no text: pass page=N to get that page as an image.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["path"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to the file to read (relative or absolute)"},"offset":{"type":"number","description":"Line number to start reading from (1-indexed)"},"limit":{"type":"number","description":"Maximum number of lines to read"},"page":{"type":"number","description":"PDF only: page number to render as an image (1-indexed), returned together with that page's text"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"ls","description":"List directory contents. Returns entries sorted alphabetically, with '/' suffix for directories. Includes dotfiles. Output is truncated to 500 entries or 50KB (whichever is hit first).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Directory to list (default: current directory)"},"limit":{"type":"number","description":"Maximum number of entries to return (default: 500)"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"grep","description":"Search file contents for a pattern. Returns matching lines with file paths and line numbers. Respects .gitignore. Output is truncated to 100 matches or 50KB (whichever is hit first). Long lines are truncated to 500 chars.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["pattern"],"properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string","description":"Search pattern (regex or literal string)"},"path":{"type":"string","description":"Directory or file to search (default: current directory)"},"glob":{"type":"string","description":"Filter files by glob pattern, e.g. '*.ts' or '**/*.spec.ts'"},"ignoreCase":{"type":"boolean","description":"Case-insensitive search (default: false)"},"literal":{"type":"boolean","description":"Treat pattern as literal string instead of regex (default: false)"},"context":{"type":"number","description":"Number of lines to show before and after each match (default: 0)"},"limit":{"type":"number","description":"Maximum number of matches to return (default: 100)"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"find","description":"Search for files by glob pattern. Returns matching file paths relative to the search directory. Respects .gitignore. Output is truncated to 1000 results or 50KB (whichever is hit first).","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["pattern"],"properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string","description":"Glob pattern to match files, e.g. '*.ts', '**/*.json', or 'src/**/*.spec.ts'"},"path":{"type":"string","description":"Directory to search in (default: current directory)"},"limit":{"type":"number","description":"Maximum number of results (default: 1000)"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"write","description":"Write content to a file. Creates the file if it doesn't exist, overwrites if it does. Automatically creates parent directories.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["purpose","path","content"],"properties":{"purpose":{"type":"string","description":"这一步要做什么，用一句话说清楚（30 字以内），会显示给所有者看"},"path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to the file to write (relative or absolute)"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"Content to write to the file"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"edit","description":"Edit a single file using exact text replacement. Every edits[].oldText must match a unique, non-overlapping region of the original file. If two changes affect the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead of emitting overlapping edits. Do not include large unchanged regions just to connect distant changes. 同一个文件要改好几处，就把它们放进同一次调用的 edits 数组：全部匹配成功才会写入，任何一处失败整个文件都不动，报错里的 edits[N] 是第几处（从 0 数起），改正那一处再整体重发。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["purpose","path","edits"],"properties":{"purpose":{"type":"string","description":"这一步要做什么，用一句话说清楚（30 字以内），会显示给所有者看"},"path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to the file to edit (relative or absolute)"},"edits":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["oldText","newText"],"properties":{"oldText":{"type":"string","description":"Exact text for one targeted replacement. It must be unique in the original file and must not overlap with any other edits[].oldText in the same call."},"newText":{"type":"string","description":"Replacement text for this targeted edit."}}},"description":"One or more targeted replacements. Each edit is matched against the original file, not incrementally. Do not include overlapping or nested edits. If two changes touch the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead."}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"powershell","description":"Execute a PowerShell command in the current working directory. Returns stdout and stderr. Output is truncated to last 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). If truncated, full output is saved to a temp file. Optionally provide a timeout in seconds (default 120, max 600). 一直跑或要很久的命令（开发服务器、监视、长时间构建）用 background=true：不等它结束，立刻返回编号，之后用 process_output 取输出、process_stop 停掉。同一个对话最多同时 8 个后台进程；后台命令没有默认超时。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["purpose","command"],"properties":{"purpose":{"type":"string","description":"这一步要做什么，用一句话说清楚（30 字以内），会显示给所有者看"},"command":{"type":"string","description":"Shell command to execute"},"timeout":{"type":"number","description":"Timeout in seconds (default 120, max 600). With background=true there is no default and no cap: leave it out to let the command run until it exits or is stopped."},"background":{"type":"boolean","description":"Run in the background and return an id immediately instead of waiting (default false). For long-running or never-ending commands; fetch output with process_output."}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"process_output","description":"取后台命令（powershell 加 background=true 起的）新增的输出：只给上次取过之后新出现的部分，并在末尾说明进程是运行中还是已结束（含退出码）。wait 填秒数时，会等到进程结束或等满这么多秒再返回（最多 300 秒），适合等构建完成、等服务起来；不填就立刻返回。单次最多显示最后 2000 行或 50KB；每个进程的输出缓冲上限 1MB，超出会丢最旧的并在结果里说明。进程结束且输出取完以后再取，会告诉你它已经结束。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["id"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"启动后台命令时返回的编号，形如 bg-1"},"wait":{"type":"number","description":"最多等多少秒（最多 300）：进程结束就提前返回；不填就不等"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"process_stop","description":"停掉一个后台命令（连它启动的整个进程树），返回停之前还没取过的输出。编号只在启动它的对话里有效。已经结束的进程不用停。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["id"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"启动后台命令时返回的编号，形如 bg-1"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"todo_write","description":"把多步骤的活列成清单，随着进展更新，让所有者看得见你做到哪了。要做三步以上、要改东西的活，第一步就先调它把步骤列出来，再开始查和改；一两步就能做完的、只是查一下看一下的不要列。同一时间最多一条\"进行中\"；做完一条马上标成\"已完成\"再做下一条。每次调用都带完整的清单，会整份替换旧的。清单界面上已经显示了，回复里不用再抄一遍。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["todos"],"properties":{"todos":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["content","status"],"properties":{"content":{"type":"string","description":"这一步要做什么，一句话"},"status":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","const":"pending"},{"type":"string","const":"in_progress"},{"type":"string","const":"completed"}],"description":"pending 还没开始 / in_progress 正在做 / completed 做完了"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"完整的清单，会替换之前整份"}},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"clipboard","description":"Read or write the text on the Windows clipboard. action \"read\" returns the clipboard text, cut to 20000 characters with a note when longer; if the clipboard holds no text (an image, a file list, or nothing) it says so. action \"write\" replaces the clipboard text with `text`. Reading needs no approval; writing follows the same approval mode as the write tool.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["action"],"properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["read","write"],"description":"read 读剪贴板里的文字；write 把 text 写进剪贴板"},"text":{"type":"string","description":"write 时要写入的文字"},"purpose":{"type":"string","description":"这一步要做什么，用一句话说清楚（30 字以内），会显示给所有者看"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"open","description":"Open a local file, a folder, or an http/https URL with the system's default program. A path must already exist; a URL must start with http:// or https://, other schemes are refused. Always needs the owner's approval, like a shell command.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["target"],"properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"文件路径、文件夹路径，或 http/https 网址"},"purpose":{"type":"string","description":"这一步要做什么，用一句话说清楚（30 字以内），会显示给所有者看"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"notify","description":"Show one Windows desktop notification with a title and an optional body. At most one notification every 10 seconds per conversation; a call sooner than that is refused with a short note. Needs no approval.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["title"],"properties":{"title":{"type":"string","description":"通知标题，一句话"},"body":{"type":"string","description":"通知正文，可省略"}}}}}]}